  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">kvinnor och entrepren&#xF6;r</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">women and entrepreneur</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen syftar till at ge 20 kvinnliga kursdeltagare den praktiska kunskap som kr&#xE4;vs f&#xF6;r att kunna starta och driva en egen verksamhet, eller driva ett projekt inom ramen f&#xF6;r redan existerande f&#xF6;retag. Rysk samarbetspartner &#xE4;r ICWM vid Murmansk State Technical University. Svensk genomf&#xF6;rande samarbetspartner &#xE4;r Centec.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project is aiming to support a training course for women entrepreneurs at the &quot;Women Management Institute&quot; at the Murmansk State technical University. The objective is to train women in their role as entrepreneurs. Swedish counterpart is Centec. Russian counterpart is ICWM at Murmansk State Technical University.</narrative>
  </description>
